From: Kernel Hacking <dev@local>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] power: thermal: Raise charging thermal-mitigation floor

Modifikasi tabel qcom,thermal-mitigation di pm660.dtsi agar arus
pengisian daya lebih stabil di suhu tinggi. Level throttle dinaikkan
sehingga charging tidak turun drastis saat device mencapai 42-50°C.

Perubahan:
- Level 1: 2500000 -> 3000000 (sama dengan level 0)
- Level 2: 2000000 -> 2500000
- Level 3: 1500000 -> 2000000
- Level 4: 1000000 -> 1500000
- Level 5: 500000  -> 1000000 (floor minimum)

Hasil: Pada suhu ~50°C charging tetap di 1500-2000mA (sebelumnya 500-1000mA)
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pm660.dtsi | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pm660.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pm660.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pm660.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/pm660.dtsi
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 		pm660_charger: qcom,qpnp-smb2 {
 			...
-			qcom,thermal-mitigation
-					= <3000000 2500000 2000000 1500000
-						1000000 500000>;
+			qcom,thermal-mitigation
+					= <3000000 3000000 2500000 2000000
+						1500000 1000000>;
